WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from
the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake
wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions
in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko
de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching
you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no
manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression
the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro
wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite
nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about
where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame
ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become
a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from
the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi
wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki
mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 44 - An Infinite Play

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:39.520
Please form a line!

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:45.020
The upper seating section is
now open! Please, enter!

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:50.000
The set and the seating has
changed around completely.

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:54.270
The lines and the cues
are all the same,

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.640
but this is a whole new <i>The
Forgotten Wilderness</i>.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:04.060
I was really surprised by
the level of her acting.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:07.740
Maya Kitajima is
a born actress.

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:11.060
Are you saying you're only interested
in her as an actress?

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:18.020
Of course. She has the potential to one
day star in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:23.460
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>...
that ghost of a play?

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:28.430
It's all for the sake of one day producing
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>...

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:30.830
that my father founded Daito Entertainment
in the first place.

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:35.610
That was the reason behind
his career move?

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:37.850
Excuse me.

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.200
It's me.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.350
What? The sponsors...

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:44.980
Chigusa Tsukikage?!

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:49.040
Bury that story! No
matter the cost!

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.090
I'm the one who'll produce
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:59.480
Not my father, nor
anyone else.

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.890
Me.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.940
Jane, stop!

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:06.510
What's that?!

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:08.500
What's going on?

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:09.910
What's this?

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:15.340
I see. The theater and the whole audience
- everything's become part of the stage.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:21.580
Once you've become part of the performance,
you can't leave your seat.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:32.310
She barely moves at all...

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:35.990
and yet, I can see exactly
where the insect landed!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:42.210
Stewart, what a farce this is!

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.240
Jane!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.660
Look at that! She's
not human!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:52.220
She's more like a domesticated wolf!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.700
The Forgotten
Wilderness

00:03:55.950 --> 00:04:01.980
Stewart, this girl can become human
under your guidance, correct?

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.760
I hope so...

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:11.410
Baron, I'm going to transform
this girl into a human!

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:12.420
I know I will!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.100
Well, hop to it!

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.790
They've changed the
production again?

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:25.700
Yes. They're going to change the
play again in five days' time,

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.800
and the media are keeping
close tabs on the story.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:31.450
If I could only live in the
wilderness... with Jane!

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:39.360
As the show changed from a tragedy to a comedy,
lots of people came to see the play a second time.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.310
Stewart!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.200
Please...

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.810
Stewart!

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.500
And the play of the hour is our featured
<i>The Lost Wilderness</i>...

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.720
What was once a tragic tale...

00:04:54.720 --> 00:05:00.460
has now become a social satire
from the perspective of a wolf.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:05.370
In five days' time, the play's direction will
transform again, no doubt spurning...

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.550
a new wave of theatergoers
to...

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:09.850
Maya, my one and only rival...

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:16.680
I'm waiting for you.

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:20.190
The sponsor walked out?

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:24.170
But that means the
show... Impossible!

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.400
It's like that time way back...

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:39.650
Back then, I tried to get funding to put on the show with
Ichiren Ozaki, but I was stopped time and time again...

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.810
by Eisuke Hayami's
dirty tricks.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:50.430
So, you're telling me your sponsor has abandoned
you and production has been halted completely?

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.440
What do you plan to do now?

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:56.590
Not only is Daito Entertainment
interested,

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.190
but a number of other good production companies
are vying for <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:04.720
I want to produce the play my
own way while I still can!

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:09.330
But, as it is now, you can't
possibly produce the play.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.610
Won't Ichiren Ozaki be turning
in his grave at this news?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.180
What do you think,
Ms. Tsukikage?

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.540
May I make a suggestion?

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:27.340
Ichiren, do I no longer possess the strength
to protect <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:30.750
My lady! Please!
Hang in there!

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.150
My lady!

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:41.760
Maya!

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.360
Ayumi!

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.510
Ms. Tsukikage!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.040
Are you okay?

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:54.850
Ma'am!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:56.770
Mr. Hayami!

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.620
Operating

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:07.690
Mistress Tsukikage has been quietly reposing
in the home of the Scarlet Angel,

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.690
alone with her memories
of Ichiren Ozaki.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:17.800
She often said that she could not leave this
world without seeing the new Scarlet Angel.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:26.180
She came back to the city again to try to arrange
a production of <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>,

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.780
but it looks like it was
all too much for her.

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:33.060
The doctor says that, even after they've
operated, she won't have long left.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:35.110
How can that be?

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:39.760
They also say that how long she has left hinges
completely on her own physical condition.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:48.440
I have to go to an event that I can't
afford to miss, but I'll call later.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.900
Ayumi...

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:03.090
This will warm you up.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:08.320
I'm fine. I don't want
your kindness.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:12.090
Just drink. If you don't
want it, throw it away.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.950
It's warm...

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.060
Are you going to
sit here all night?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:26.040
I'd like to be by her side,
if only for a little while.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:33.050
She's the one who gave me my <i>raison d'être</i>:
acting. Me - a girl who couldn't get anything right.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:36.440
I want to play in <i>The
Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:39.390
Keeping that goal in sight has brought
me to the point I've reached today.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:44.650
But if I ever do star in <i>The
Scarlet Angel</i>,

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:49.530
I feel that I would finally
become a real actress!

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:52.520
Then, I suppose you're praying for
the operation to be a success.

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:58.400
What exactly are you doing
here, Mr. Hayami?

00:08:58.400 --> 00:08:59.860
Because it's my job.

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:03.880
The life of the person who holds the rights to
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i> is on the line here.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.240
I don't even want
to look at you!

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:12.390
Fine with me. It looks like you've
got a little bit of your spunk back.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:17.890
I suppose anger is better
than sadness any day.

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:24.730
Maya, what draws me
to you is your soul.

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:27.790
The passion on which your
whole being rides.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:33.810
Your <i>raison
d'être</i>, huh?

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:37.720
Something that was
never mine to have.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:42.020
Ever since I sensed at a young age what my
fate was going to be.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:54.650
Ms. Tsukikage!

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.070
Ma'am...

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:02.560
She has to stay completely still. What happens
from here on is entirely up to her.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:07.170
She's in a coma, but if she doesn't
regain consciousness soon...

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.400
What happens then?

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.400
You'll have to prepare for
the worst, if that happens.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.050
Ms. Tsukikage...

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:29.680
Yes, Himekawa here.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:32.090
What did you say?!

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:42.400
Ichiren, where are you?

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:44.000
Where are you?

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:52.900
Ichiren, I wanted to
see you so badly...

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.090
Ichiren!

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:04.380
Ma'am... no! I don't
want you to die!

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:07.700
Ma'am! Ma'am!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.970
Ichiren...

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:16.790
My darling!

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:25.630
Ma'am!

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.540
Ma'am,

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.570
can you hear me?

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:33.020
It's me, Ayumi.

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:38.400
I don't want to become the
Scarlet Angel like this!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:44.400
Ever since I was little, I've
wanted to play that role.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:48.880
I believed there was nothing I couldn't
achieve if I only put enough effort in.

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:55.840
For the first time in my life, since meeting Maya
Kitajima, I have tasted defeat for real!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:12:00.060
I want to believe in
myself! Please!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:03.820
I want to beat her to
the role in a fair fight!

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:09.340
With my rival still around, I'd never
be able to play the Scarlet Angel!

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:15.050
Please, keep on living! Please live and
let us fight over your Scarlet Angel!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:20.510
Chigusa, please grant eternal life
to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:21.530
Please.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.430
Wait, Ichiren!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.470
Ichiren!

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:30.610
Ma'am...

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.810
Ms. Tsukikage!

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:37.980
She's back! Her pulse is back!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.350
I can't believe it...
It's a miracle!

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.060
Ms. Tsukikage.

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:44.430
Ma'am!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.320
Thank God!

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:50.850
Ms. Tsukikage, I can't have
you dying on me now.

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:55.700
I need your help to secure <i>The
Scarlet Angel</i> for me.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:13:02.170
You are the only person
who can do that.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.720
It looks like she's stable
for the time being.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.490
Ayumi,

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.580
about what you said before...

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.230
What, you've never noticed?

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:16.700
I've envied you for
a long time now.

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:18.730
Envied me?

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.920
But, how is that possible?

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:23.000
Everyone calls her a genius...

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:23.890
Maya.

00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:24.720
Yes?

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.110
I'll see you later.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.470
So, the dream hasn't
ended just yet.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.220
Your luck is devilish.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.790
Devilish luck?! My
tutor almost died!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.460
I'm amazed.

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:39.460
What?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.460
By your devilish luck and
the sheer lack of my own.

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:47.470
Little one, do you have any idea what everyone's
talking about at the Acting Festival?

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.960
They're talking about
your wolf girl, Jane.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.900
The agency is having a hard time
dealing with all the publicity.

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:56.940
It seems that Lady Luck noticed
you after you bit me.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.030
Mr. Hayami.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.780
And it looks like the Scarlet Angel
in the hospital bed is immortal too.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:04.320
In any case, I'm happy
for you, little one.

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:11.530
Why is he being like this? He's
acting nice for a change.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:18.040
<i>The Forgotten Wilderness</i> is enjoying a long run
and has become one of this year's hottest talking points.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:23.430
We are especially taken
with Maya Kitajima's compellingly real depiction
of Jane the wolf girl.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:27.550
I wouldn't even believe it was the same
show; I could watch it again and again!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:31.140
This is Ryuuzo Kuronuma's gauntlet,
thrown down to the acting world!

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:36.670
Maya Kitajima. It makes sense that
Masumi's so obsessed with her.

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:43.720
Her earnest approach to acting is exactly how
Chigusa Tsukikage was when she was young.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.720
Is this really all right?

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:50.470
Couldn't you have seen
her at least once?

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:53.070
Ayumi has brought so many
gifts for you as well.

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:56.570
Genzo, I am only going
to meet them...

00:14:56.570 --> 00:15:00.110
when it's time for them to compete
for the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:02.550
There is no need for any extra pity.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:04.210
My lady!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:05.480
Doctor?

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:06.140
Yes?

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:07.680
How much longer?

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:08.550
Excuse me?

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:11.020
How much longer do
I have left to live?

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:15.270
Do I have a year - no,
half a year maybe?

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.970
What are you talking
about, ma'am?

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:22.070
The operation was a success and you'll
be able to leave the hospital soon.

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:23.780
He's right, my lady.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.770
This doctor can't act
to save his life...

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:32.430
I'd like at least a year to live.

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:35.380
Until the new Scarlet
Angel is born.

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.800
My days as Jane
the wolf girl...

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:42.680
are coming to an end!

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.040
This is it!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:51.020
Ichiren, you gave me life.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:58.450
You taught me how to act and you gave
me the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:03.310
We could never have
been together,

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:10.260
but when we were on stage,
our souls became one.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.150
My lady!

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:17.010
Let's retire to the home of <i>The
Scarlet Angel</i> once more.

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.260
What does this mean?

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:27.280
Ms. Tsukikage has gone back to the
home of <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:29.710
But how did she manage
that in her state?

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:32.380
Where is this place?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.340
I can't give you that information
at the moment.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.710
She has asked me to
keep it confidential.

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:38.470
Then, when can you tell us?

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.870
In a week's time, after the Acting
Festival announces its decision.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.790
She will only reveal her location to the person
who is qualified to win the role...

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.790
of the Scarlet Angel.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:51.600
Whether that is Miss Ayumi alone, or
both of you, has yet to be decided.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:55.360
She will await the
results there.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.510
She will only reveal her location to the person
qualified to play the Scarlet Angel...

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:07.470
This will decide everything.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.660
If Maya Kitajima does not win an
award at the Acting Festival,

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:17.470
or the equally prestigious National Japanese
Association Acting Award,

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:21.480
then all rights to play the Scarlet Angel
will default to Ayumi Himekawa.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:27.280
I've dreamed about <i>The Scarlet
Angel</i> for so long.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:33.840
If I don't receive this award, and
Ayumi ends up playing the role,

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:39.510
I'll have to make sure I stay cheerful and
congratulate her with good grace.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:45.190
I love acting, no matter what
the result is here today.

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:49.300
I want to keep on living
as an actress forever.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.800
Maya.

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.240
Sakurakouji.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:18:00.390
Little one, all I can do now
is watch you from afar.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.270
But no matter what happens...

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:05.720
And now, here are the results
of the acting categories!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:12.890
I'll keep on watching you
for as long as you live.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:18.900
The award for Best Male Newcomer goes
to Yuu Sakurakouji for his role of Stewart,

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:20.990
in <i>The Forgotten
Wilderness</i>.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:22.480
Maya.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.510
Congratulations, Sakurakouji!

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:30.330
The Best Director Award goes to Ryuuzo Kuronuma
for <i>The Forgotten Wilderness</i>.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.530
The Best Show Award goes to <i>The
Forgotten Wilderness</i>.

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:36.640
Next, the Best Actress
Award goes to:

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:40.720
Miss Madoka Enjouji for her starring
role in <i>Isadora</i>.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:47.220
The Grand Acting Award goes to Acting
Troupe Aishuu's Jou Tagami.

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.780
And now, we would like to announce the
recipient of our most prestigious award:

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:53.380
the coveted Japanese Acting
Association Award.

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:04.470
It goes to Maya Kitajima for her role as Jane
in <i>The Forgotten Wilderness.</i>

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.100
Congratulations, Maya!

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:16.460
Is this really happening?
It's like a dream!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:20.400
I can act in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> now!
I can fight with Ayumi for the role!

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:32.590
Now that she has won this prestigious
award, Miss Maya Kitajima...

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:38.280
will be able to compete for the role of the
Scarlet Angel in the legendary play,
a will expressed by Ms. Chigusa Tsukikage.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:42.060
Also, Ms. Tsukikage has requested
that the administration of the production of
<i>The Scarlet Angel<i>...</i></i>

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:47.180
is to be handled by the Japanese
Acting Association.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.420
What's the meaning of
this, Mr. Masumi?!

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:55.690
It means that direction, casting, and the venue
will all be decided by the Association.

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:59.490
You don't seem upset by this at all! You've
got something up your sleeve, haven't you?

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:03.380
You're going to somehow get this piece back
for Daito Entertainment, aren't you?

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:09.060
You two will visit Ms. Tsukikage in the
home of <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:13.170
Once there, you should give your best shot at learning all
there is to know about <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:15.650
Yes, sir!

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.370
Congratulations, little one.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:23.690
Mr. Hayami?

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:27.380
It seems like you grabbed your one
percent chance with both hands.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:29.700
Thank you very much,
President Hayami.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.680
I wish the future Scarlet
Angel luck.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:37.170
Um... thank you.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:42.450
I see you've picked another worthy challenge for
yourself, fighting against Ayumi Himekawa...

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:45.070
for the role of the unearthly
beauty, the Scarlet Angel...

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:47.280
Well, I know I'm just...

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.970
Do your best.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.090
Miss Maya Kitajima?

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:54.310
Yes.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.970
These are for you.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.780
They're from him!

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.180
Congratulations
on your award!

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:05.540
Finally, the Scarlet Angel
is within reach.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:07.760
Your performance as Jane the
wolf girl was truly wonderful,

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:11.800
especially the scene where you
grabbed Stewart's blue scarf...

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:14.670
and finally realized your
own humanity.

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:17.680
Blue scarf?

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.410
But we only used that
one on the first day.

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:24.380
Every show since then,
we've used a red scarf.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.150
The opening day was the
day of the typhoon...

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:32.010
There was only one person
in the audience that day.

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:39.300
The person whose been watching me since
day one, supporting me from the wings,

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:43.640
my one and only fan, extending a helping
hand whenever I needed it...

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:47.250
Was that really you,
Mr. Hayami?

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello hello

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:56.680
Hello, hello.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Fukanou dato iwarenagara
tobitatte

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:15.280
Even though they say it's
impossible, I fly off.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
Kanaeta yume mo koboreochita
yume mo aru

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:25.160
There are dreams that come true,
and dreams that crumble away.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
Soredemo isshoukenmei ikiru
kazu dake hoshi ga fueru

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:36.830
But even then, for every person trying hard
to live their life, a new star is born.

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Kyou mo mata hitotsu
umareru hoshi miagete

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:49.240
Today, I look up again, at
another newly born star.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:50.570
And I say,

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello, hello another star.

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:53.890
Hello hello another star

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything will change.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:57.030
If I wish anything
will change

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
I've boarded the shuttle
with my love.

00:22:57.030 --> 00:23:02.770
Ai wo daite norikonda
shatoru

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Every single person
is an astronaut.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.120
Daremo ga hitori no
uchuuhikoushi dayo

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
From fulfilled dream to dream,

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:14.190
Negau yume
kara yume e

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
I can go anywhere... One life.

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:21.470
Dokomademo
yukeru one life

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:24.960
There was a room in the back which
I was never allowed to go near.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:29.550
Ms. Tsukikage, you were in that
room as the Scarlet Angel.

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:33.570
Everything should have been engulfed
by flames and reduced to ash.

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:39.610
Why did my mother risk her life to
save the Scarlet Angel's robe?

00:23:39.610 --> 00:23:47.120
Eisuke Hayami, I'm going to grasp the thing you could
never have, no matter how badly you wanted it.

00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 45 -
Stars of the City

00:23:47.120 --> 00:23:50.740
I became your son for one reason
alone - to take it for myself.
